### Edge cases

- If you believe the failure is **not fixable via CSV changes** (e.g. a broken source repo, missing tag, disk-full), emit `{"ops": [], "notes": "<reason>"}`. The orchestrator will stop retrying.
- If prior attempts already tried the same op and it didn't help, **do something different** — don't loop.
- Keep `ops` small per attempt (ideally 1–3 ops). The orchestrator retries after each attempt, so you can iterate.

After writing the file, re-read it to confirm it's valid JSON. Your response text itself is not parsed — only the file matters. Keep your response short.
